{"id":12239,"date":"2024-10-07T09:51:33","date_gmt":"2024-10-07T09:51:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12239"},"modified":"2024-10-07T10:02:52","modified_gmt":"2024-10-07T10:02:52","slug":"mereni-isomeru-vodiku-pomoci-in-line-ramanovy-spektroskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/mereni-isomeru-vodiku-pomoci-in-line-ramanovy-spektroskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"M\u011b\u0159en\u00ed isomer\u016f vod\u00edku pomoc\u00ed in-line Ramanovy spektroskopie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Vod\u00edk hraje kl\u00ed\u010dovou roli v budoucnosti energetiky d\u00edky sv\u00e9mu potenci\u00e1lu pro dekarbonizaci. Aby mohl b\u00fdt bezpe\u010dn\u011b a efektivn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n, je d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e9 ho skladovat a p\u0159epravovat v kapaln\u00e9m stavu, co\u017e vy\u017eaduje teploty kolem 20 K. V t\u011bchto podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch prob\u00edh\u00e1 p\u0159em\u011bna ortho- a paravod\u00edku, co\u017e m\u00e1 z\u00e1sadn\u00ed v\u00fdznam pro minimalizaci energetick\u00fdch ztr\u00e1t a prevenci odpa\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed vod\u00edku p\u0159i skladov\u00e1n\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>P\u0159i pokojov\u00e9 teplot\u011b tvo\u0159\u00ed ortovod\u00edk p\u0159ibli\u017en\u011b 75 % sm\u011bsi vod\u00edkov\u00fdch molekul, zat\u00edmco paravod\u00edk p\u0159edstavuje zbyl\u00fdch 25 %. S klesaj\u00edc\u00ed teplotou se tento pom\u011br m\u011bn\u00ed, p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e p\u0159i teplot\u011b 20 K je t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 100 % vod\u00edku v paraform\u011b, kter\u00e1 je termodynamicky stabiln\u011bj\u0161\u00ed. Proces p\u0159em\u011bny z ortovod\u00edku na paravod\u00edk je v\u0161ak exergonick\u00fd a generuje velk\u00e9 mno\u017estv\u00ed tepla, co\u017e m\u016f\u017ee zp\u016fsobit odpa\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed ulo\u017een\u00e9ho kapaln\u00e9ho vod\u00edku.<\/p>\n<p>K monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed tohoto procesu je ide\u00e1ln\u00ed metodou <strong>Ramanova spektroskopie<\/strong>. Poskytuje rychl\u00e9 a p\u0159esn\u00e9 informace o pom\u011bru ortho- a paravod\u00edku, co\u017e je kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 pro optimalizaci pr\u016fmyslov\u00fdch proces\u016f, jako je t\u0159eba v\u00fdroba kapaln\u00e9ho vod\u00edku.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12240\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12240\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12240\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/10\/a33db7af-300x230.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"383\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/10\/a33db7af-300x230.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/10\/a33db7af.png 649w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12240\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ramanovy p\u00e1sy r\u016fzn\u00fdch izomer\u016f vod\u00edku<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>V\u00fdhody Ramanovy spektroskopie<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Ramanova spektroskopie je d\u00edky sv\u00e9 rychlosti a jednoduchosti implementace st\u00e1le obl\u00edben\u011bj\u0161\u00ed v pr\u016fmyslov\u00fdch aplikac\u00edch a z hlediska sledov\u00e1n\u00ed vod\u00edku poskytuje zejm\u00e9na n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00ed v\u00fdhody:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rychl\u00e1 m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed:<\/strong> D\u00edky kr\u00e1tk\u00fdm \u010das\u016fm odezvy je mo\u017en\u00e9 sledovat procesy v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Odolnost p\u0159i extr\u00e9mn\u00edch podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Ramanova spektroskopie funguje i v kryogenn\u00edch podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch, co\u017e je ide\u00e1ln\u00ed pro m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed kapaln\u00e9ho vod\u00edku p\u0159i n\u00edzk\u00fdch teplot\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Praktick\u00e9 vyu\u017eit\u00ed<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>V r\u00e1mci pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9 v\u00fdroby kapaln\u00e9ho vod\u00edku se pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed katalyz\u00e1tory pro urychlen\u00ed p\u0159em\u011bny ortovod\u00edku na paravod\u00edk. Pomal\u00fd pr\u016fb\u011bh t\u00e9to p\u0159em\u011bny by mohl v\u00e9st k p\u0159eh\u0159\u00e1t\u00ed a n\u00e1sledn\u00e9mu odpa\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed vod\u00edku. Nasazen\u00edm Ramanovy spektroskopie je mo\u017en\u00e9 sledovat efektivitu t\u00e9to katalytick\u00e9 reakce v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase, co\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje zvy\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed efektivity cel\u00e9ho procesu.<\/p>\n<p>Pou\u017eit\u00ed <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\"><strong>in-line Ramanovy spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a> umo\u017e\u0148uje kontinu\u00e1ln\u00ed monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed slo\u017een\u00ed vod\u00edku a rychlost p\u0159em\u011bny isomer\u016f, \u010d\u00edm\u017e zaji\u0161\u0165uje stabilitu a bezpe\u010dnost skladovan\u00e9ho vod\u00edku. V\u00edce se m\u016f\u017eete dozv\u011bd\u011bt <a href=\"https:\/\/assets.thermofisher.com\/TFS-Assets\/CAD\/Reference-Materials\/measuring-hydrogen-raman-spec-article.pdf\">zde<\/a>.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12242\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12242\" style=\"width: 361px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12242 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/10\/9d8071ba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"361\" height=\"541\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/10\/9d8071ba.png 361w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/10\/9d8071ba-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 361px) 100vw, 361px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12242\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Vysokotlak\u00e1 pr\u016ftokov\u00e1 cela pro m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed Ramanov\u00fdch spekter kompatibiln\u00ed s <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\">na\u0161imi Ramanov\u00fdmi spektrometry<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vod\u00edk hraje kl\u00ed\u010dovou roli v budoucnosti energetiky d\u00edky sv\u00e9mu potenci\u00e1lu pro dekarbonizaci. Aby mohl b\u00fdt bezpe\u010dn\u011b